	(text "J_DAQ IS NOT FITTED IN REV A (O-19).\nIt was wired to umbilical pins 8/9, which reach NOTHING on the\nbench: no buffer, no source. A connector present at both ends of\na dead pair reads as a working analog backup, so it is unpopulated\nand its pins are flagged rather than left inviting a DAQ.\nPin 3 also exported bench GND to the laptop bench, which bridges\nthe isolation barrier whenever a mains-powered DAQ shares it.\nLoss of path-2 redundancy for Rev A is recorded in REQUIREMENTS.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 282.0000 310.0000 0)
